 This project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
 
+## Unreleased
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Security: with `{ requireWellFormed: true }`, `XMLSerializer.serializeToString()` (and `Node.toString()`, `NodeList.toString()`) now throws `InvalidStateError` when a serialized attribute's qualified name — including synthesized `xmlns:PREFIX` namespace declarations — does not match the XML `QName` production. This prevents attribute injection through names passed to `Element.setAttribute()`, which still does not validate names at creation time. Default serialization is unchanged. [`GHSA-4w3w-2rp5-g8jm`](https://github.com/xmldom/xmldom/security/advisories/GHSA-4w3w-2rp5-g8jm)
+
 ## [0.9.10](https://github.com/xmldom/xmldom/compare/0.9.9...0.9.10)
 
 ### Fixed
